# pdz_latency_log test, Datacore (tools/latency): boot -> Datacore with A (as PDZRenderResearch datacore.script),
# then from 105 s alternately the right stick pushed right for 0.3 s and the trigger pulled for 0.12 s, 1.5 s apart,
# so each change is timed to the first frame whose view turns / gun fires (pdz_latency: / frame_pacing: reaction).
repeat 8 100 2.0 A 0.15
stick 105.0 0.3 0 0 32767 0
pad 106.5 RT 0.12
stick 108.0 0.3 0 0 32767 0
pad 109.5 RT 0.12
